<tr><td colspan=2>Da guild duel orginally scheduled for dis comin sunday, has been rescheduled fer sunday December 10.  Also, to better accomodate Darakryn and Harkkonen, weez will schedule it a bit earlier at 12 noon PST (3pm EST).<br>
<br>
Da reason fer da reschedule is due to da fact that me has had many people tell meez dat dey prolly not be able to make it and me wuz stoopid to originally schedule it on a day when me had RL plans dat me fergot about. Sorry fer da change, but it not gunna work for some people (me included).<br>
<br>
If ya want, thoze of ya who iz much thirsty fer blood can use dis sunday to practice fer da real duel a weekz later...<br>
<br>
RARR!<br>
 - Runja</td></tr><tr><td colspan=2>&nbsp;</td></tr>

